  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Waterproof V-Max Lightweight Tactical Boots are the ultimate solution for those seeking waterproof tactical footwear. Engineered with the toughest conditions in mind, these boots are designed to keep water out even in the most extreme environments. Crafted with a gusseted tongue, Nubuck leather, and denier nylon material, along with a breathable membrane, they offer exceptional waterproofing capabilities without compromising breathability.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132880",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Waterproof V-Max Lightweight Tactical Boots are the ultimate solution for those seeking waterproof tactical footwear. Engineered with the toughest conditions in mind, these boots are designed to keep water out even in the most extreme environments. Crafted with a gusseted tongue, Nubuck leather, and denier nylon material, along with a breathable membrane, they offer exceptional waterproofing capabilities without compromising breathability. Modeled after running shoes, these active-duty-style cross-training boots feature a rubber/EVA outsole that delivers superior traction, ensuring stability and grip on challenging terrain. Despite their rugged construction, these boots remain lightweight and flexible, thanks to a removable EVA insole that provides cushioning and support for long days on your feet. With a height of 8.5 inches, these tactical boots offer ample ankle support and protection, courtesy of a padded collar. This feature enhances stability and minimizes the risk of injuries during demanding activities. Additionally, the rustproof iron eyelet lace system ensures durability and longevity, allowing you to lace up securely without worrying about corrosion. Ideal for active-duty professionals, law enforcement officers, outdoor enthusiasts, and anyone else in need of reliable waterproof footwear, Rothco's V-Max Tactical Boots are the perfect blend of performance, comfort, and durability. Whether you're navigating wet terrain, traversing rugged landscapes, or on duty in unpredictable weather conditions, these boots have got you covered, ensuring you stay dry, comfortable, and agile in any environment.</p>",
